# Ducal Hospitality (jeuno 68): Taillegeas shared with Trust: Cherukiki (a hidden quest: ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1, a trust
# permit, Cherukiki not learned, CoP Dawn current with Status 2 or more), whose onTrigger answers progressEvent 10235.
# Both containers answer each talk, so the kind of the quest's reply decides which plays (a progressEvent ties with
# 10235 and the tie rotates by the last event id; an event loses to it). A level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 4, CoP Dawn
# current with Status 2 (The Warrior's Path completed: [0] 1), a Windurst Trust Permit. Available: the talk (the quest
# draws a set either way); the finish with option 10 (not 2: Cherukiki not learned; the quest not begun). Accepted with
# ItemSet 2 (a GM): the talk again (10059 against 10235). Completed with the mustZone (a GM): 10060 against 10235; then
# ItemSet 3 (a GM): 10059 against 10235; then ItemSet 0 and no mustZone (out and back): a draw, 10057 against 10235.
lists RuludeGardens/Taillegeas/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10057 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10059 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10060 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10235
